# Build context for the vLLM serving image ().
#
# The context is this directory ONLY (see .gitlab/ci/build.yml `build-vllm`
# -> DOCKER_CONTEXT), so it is already tiny. This file keeps it that way and
# guarantees that nothing which could carry a secret or a model blob is ever
# sent to the daemon — this image is pushed to a registry, so context hygiene
# is not cosmetic.
*
!Dockerfile
!build-verify.py
